[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18660.628, "timestamp": "05:11:00", "text": "他们喜欢火，因为他们别无选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18663.83, "timestamp": "05:11:03", "text": "我喜欢火，所以他们也必须喜欢火。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18666.628, "timestamp": "05:11:06", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18668.39, "timestamp": "05:11:08", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18670.39, "timestamp": "05:11:10", "text": "我一直想问问你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18673.27, "timestamp": "05:11:13", "text": "YouTube上有很多东西之类的。是什么激发了灵感"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18676.31, "timestamp": "05:11:16", "text": "你会喜欢这个模型设计的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18678.15, "timestamp": "05:11:18", "text": "一切？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18680.948, "timestamp": "05:11:20", "text": "嗯，模型设计。我觉得我的第一个呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18683.59, "timestamp": "05:11:23", "text": "当时的想法就像我想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18685.91, "timestamp": "05:11:25", "text": "这意味着我可能会把它更新为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18687.83, "timestamp": "05:11:27", "text": "出色地。但就目前而言，是为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18690.868, "timestamp": "05:11:30", "text": "基本上就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18692.628, "timestamp": "05:11:32", "text": "我想留下那件裙子，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18694.39, "timestamp": "05:11:34", "text": "所有我想做的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18699.51, "timestamp": "05:11:39", "text": "用 RL 相机做点什么之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18702.47, "timestamp": "05:11:42", "text": "如果我去参加某个活动、见面会或做某事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18704.07, "timestamp": "05:11:44", "text": "我希望能够做到类似的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18707.19, "timestamp": "05:11:47", "text": "装扮成我扮演的角色。我爱M"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18710.23, "timestamp": "05:11:50", "text": "蝴蝶和花朵尤其如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18714.55, "timestamp": "05:11:54", "text": "嗯，我确实放了很多花夹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18716.31, "timestamp": "05:11:56", "text": "还有一些现实生活中的东西，比如我头发上的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18719.51